<title>USA: Most U.S. debt futures close slightly lower.</title>
<headline>Most U.S. debt futures close slightly lower.</headline>
<text>
<p>Dec 10 - Most U.S. debt futures closed slightly lower in thin trade. One U.S. institution sold about 2,000 March T-bonds. Large offers at 114-12/32 to 114-13/32 kept the market from testing the day's highs. Traders said the market had little response to 0.8-pct increase in weekly Redbook sales.</p>
